============================================================
14. AUTHENTICATION
============================================================

Implement real authentication.

Required:

Register
Login
Logout
Refresh authentication
Forgot password
Reset password
Protected routes

Passwords must be securely hashed.

Never store plaintext passwords.

Never expose authentication secrets.

Frontend route protection is NOT security.

Backend authorization is mandatory.


============================================================
15. ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL
============================================================

Every protected backend operation must verify:

Authentication
+
Role
+
Campus
+
Resource ownership/permission where appropriate

Example:

Student cannot:

- access admin APIs
- approve resources
- suspend users
- view audit logs

Frontend hiding is NOT sufficient.

Backend must reject unauthorized requests.


