============================================================
27. GAMIFICATION
============================================================

XP must represent real contribution.

Examples:

Approved resource +20
Create project +10
Complete project +100
Attend event +20
Help student +15
Challenge +50
Mentor +30

Use an XP transaction table.

Prevent duplicate rewards.

Never allow frontend to directly decide XP amount.


============================================================
28. BADGES
============================================================

