============================================================
37. DATABASE INDEXING
============================================================

At minimum consider indexes for:

users(campus_id)
users(email)

resources(campus_id)
resources(subject_id)

projects(campus_id)
projects(status)

events(campus_id)
events(start_time)

notifications(user_id)
notifications(created_at)

xp_transactions(user_id)
xp_transactions(created_at)

Do not blindly add hundreds of indexes.


