38. BACKEND STRUCTURE
============================================================

Keep it SMALL.

Suggested:

backend/
    app/
        main.py
        core/
        database/
        modules/
        integrations/
        jobs/
    tests/

Inside modules:

auth
users
campus
academics
resources
projects
events
opportunities
announcements
notifications
gamification
admin

Do NOT create unnecessary layers.

Each module can contain:

router
schemas
models
service

Add repository/permission files ONLY when actually useful.

Do not mechanically create five files for every module.


============================================================
39. FRONTEND STRUCTURE
============================================================

Keep frontend architecture clean.

Example:

frontend/
    src/
        App.tsx
        main.tsx

        components/
        features/
        pages/
        layouts/
        services/
        hooks/
        lib/
        types/
        styles/

Do NOT create dozens of folders.

Use feature grouping where useful.

Do not create a separate folder for every button/card/input.

Reusable UI belongs in a shared UI area.


