============================================================
68. SECURITY AUDIT BEFORE COMPLETION
============================================================

Before saying DONE, test:

Can Student access admin API?

Can Student access another campus?

Can Student manipulate XP?

Can Student approve resource?

Can Student upload dangerous file?

Can suspended user continue accessing protected resources?

Can user access another user's private information?

Can duplicate project applications occur?

Can duplicate XP rewards occur?

Can unauthorized admin actions happen?

Can secrets be found in frontend bundle?

Can API return sensitive fields?

FIX EVERYTHING FOUND.


============================================================
69. DATABASE AUDIT
============================================================

Check:

Foreign keys
Indexes
Unique constraints
Duplicate prevention
Cascade behavior
Soft deletion
Migration from empty database
Seed script

Run migrations on a clean database.

The application must work from zero.


